flowchart TD
    A[Published schedule] --> B[Classroom event]
    B --> C{Trigger}
    C -->|Quiz failure| D[Compute concept mastery]
    C -->|Cancelled class| E[Reduce available sessions]
    C -->|Ran over| F[Increase remaining duration]
    C -->|Teacher lock| G[Add hard constraint]

    D --> H[Propose remediation]
    E --> I[Compile solver input]
    F --> I
    G --> I
    H --> I

    I --> J[OR-Tools CP-SAT]
    J --> K{Feasible?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Create schedule version]
    K -->|No| M[Generate resolution options]
    L --> N[Generate machine diff]
    N --> O[LLM explains actual diff]
    O --> P[Teacher approves]
    P --> Q[Publish]
